    <name>Task: Check with your supervisor about workflows</name>
    <intro>&lt;h6&gt;&lt;img class="img-fluid" style="float: left; padding-right: 10px;" role="presentation" src="@@PLUGINFILE@@/Task.png" alt="" width="100" height="100"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Reach out to your supervisor to check if you will be using workflows&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;</intro>
    <introformat>1</introformat>
    <content>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img class="img-fluid" style="float: left; padding-right: 10px;" role="presentation" src="@@PLUGINFILE@@/Task.png" alt="" width="150" height="150"&gt;Task&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;em&gt;Send a message to your supervisor, asking if you will need to use any workflows. This should be done early on, so the Operations Team can add the appropriate permissions beforehand.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please do not mark this activity as done until you have sent the email. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
